menu "ISM330DLC driver configuration"

    config ESP32_ISM330DLC_USE_FREERTOS_DELAY
        bool "Use FreeRTOS for ISM330DLC initialization delays"
        default n
        help
            Use vTaskDelay() while waiting for the ISM330DLC software reset.
            When disabled, the driver uses esp_rom_delay_us() instead and does
            not directly depend on the FreeRTOS delay API.

endmenu
